                            <comment id="14942587" author="moon" created="Sun, 4 Oct 2015 07:45:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Have you tried z.angularBind() before z.angular(), especially after zeppelin restart?&lt;br/&gt;
Zeppelin restored previously binded angular value to front-end side after restart but does not  restore it backend side.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So you may able to read binded value after restart in the frontend, but not in backend before do z.angularBind() again&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14943021" author="samalexg" created="Mon, 5 Oct 2015 07:50:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;By using z.angularBind() before z.angular(), it worked.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But the textbox is having a issue. When we type something in normal speed, that characters are getting replaced. We have to type very slowly to enter the correct text into text box. Is this a known issue?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve attached the recording of this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14955086" author="moon" created="Tue, 13 Oct 2015 15:05:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing problem and the video. i could reproduce the error. Let me try to fix it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
